    "type": "game",
    "name": "Jumping Steve",
    "steam_appid": 2844950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping Steve is a 2d arcade style indy game with lots to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tutorials, no cut scenes, very little reading, extremely fast loading times and lots of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Fast arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Mini Games (And more planned).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Retro style with modern unique design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Many achievements with hints throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Several challenges for the hardcore gamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Simple gameplay with lots of stuff to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7.\u00a0A longer description, WOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Steve and jump to stay on the crows, collect the thingys and stay alive for as long as you can to increase your score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete random tasks and less random tasks like staying alive for 2 minutes to tick the boxes in your achievement list to increase the power of your log book. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock power ups in classic mode or use the M.O.D machine for some randomised madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its arcade style of play is  perfect for taking in turns with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A score board so you know whos better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 2 can drop in or drop out at almost any time for some 2 player madness or go to the 2 player only VS mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;unique&quot; indie style of its own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit Camp Aign on the search for The Main Thingy and collect more Thingys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items like the Upgraded shirt to improve your jumping and score or other items to do other stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 minutes of original music to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with touch screen devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first game ever made by Steves Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created using Construct</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping Steve is a 2d arcade style indy game with lots to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tutorials, no cut scenes, very little reading, extremely fast loading times and lots of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Fast arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Mini Games (And more planned).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Retro style with modern unique design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Many achievements with hints throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Several challenges for the hardcore gamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Simple gameplay with lots of stuff to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7.\u00a0A longer description, WOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Steve and jump to stay on the crows, collect the thingys and stay alive for as long as you can to increase your score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete random tasks and less random tasks like staying alive for 2 minutes to tick the boxes in your achievement list to increase the power of your log book. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock power ups in classic mode or use the M.O.D machine for some randomised madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its arcade style of play is  perfect for taking in turns with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A score board so you know whos better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 2 can drop in or drop out at almost any time for some 2 player madness or go to the 2 player only VS mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;unique&quot; indie style of its own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit Camp Aign on the search for The Main Thingy and collect more Thingys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items like the Upgraded shirt to improve your jumping and score or other items to do other stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 minutes of original music to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with touch screen devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first game ever made by Steves Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created using Construct</p>",
